sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Founder
    participant CEO as CEO Agent
    participant NATS as NATS JetStream
    participant CTO as CTO Agent
    participant BE as Backend Agent
    participant CSO as CSO Agent
    participant DEVOPS as DevOps Agent

    F->>CEO: Strategic directive
    CEO->>NATS: Publish task assignment
    NATS->>CTO: Task: architect new feature
    CTO->>NATS: Design approved, assign implementation
    NATS->>BE: Task: implement API endpoint
    BE->>NATS: Code committed, request review
    NATS->>CSO: Security review request
    CSO->>NATS: Review passed ✓
    NATS->>DEVOPS: Deploy to staging
    DEVOPS->>NATS: Deployed ✓
    NATS->>CEO: Status: feature shipped
    CEO->>F: Weekly report: feature complete
